Azure shared-key and Docker Base64 decoding, API Management repository URL
serialization, DevOps line scanning and SAS/Function request guards reimplement
selected Go 1.26.7 encoding/base64, net/url, bufio and net/http behavior in C. Coinbase
reimplements selected encoding/pem and crypto/x509 SEC1 validation mechanics.
Datadog token response projection follows selected encoding/json pointer and
slice-reuse mechanics. DeepAI's fixed multipart form follows selected
mime/multipart writer behavior. Enigma's ASCII Content-Type diagnostics and Figma's
ASCII 403 response diagnostics follow selected strconv quoting behavior.
Freshbooks request guards and Geocodio/HereAPI query/fragment projection
follow selected net/url and net/http constructor behavior. Shared byte URL
parsing/query projection and Jira endpoint-host/request-URL projection follow
selected net/url, net/netip and net/http rules, including the pinned binary's
urlstrictcolons=0 compatibility setting. The private DefaultClient
background-context JSON-POST boundary follows selected net/http/client.go and
request.go behavior, without claiming native transport equivalence.
Google credential string projection and ordered marshaling follow selected
encoding/json string behavior. Google and GitHub OAuth form encoding, limited
response reads and selected error handling follow golang.org/x/oauth2 v0.34.0, commit
acc38155b7f6f36aefcb58faff6f36d314dd915c, under the same BSD-3-Clause text.
Owned HTTP singleflight ordering follows golang.org/x/sync v0.21.0, commit
5071ed6a9f1617117556b66384f765c934de3698, under that same BSD text.
FTP URL projection and control replies follow selected net/url, net/textproto
and bufio behavior, including the generated URL escaping table.
GoCanvas XML response projection follows selected encoding/xml struct, direct-text
and integer-decoding behavior, with a narrower explicit supported subset.
Google OAuth token expiry follows selected strconv.ParseInt and time.Unix/String
behavior only within its explicit UTC configuration and calendar subset.
Vault token URL joining follows selected rooted path.Clean/Join and net/url.JoinPath
behavior. Harness, Vault, Hasura and HuggingFace response projection follow selected
encoding/json typed-field, integer and value-struct/string-slice reuse rules.
Selected Unicode 15.0 category, whitespace and lowercase ranges derive from
Go 1.26.7 src/unicode/tables.go; regenerate them with tools/generate_go_unicode.py.
